        </div>
        <div class="defect-card">
          <h3><span>🛡️ 2</span> Premature Capitulation Distortion</h3>
          <p>Linguistic leaking of structural hesitation ("might potentially try to suggest") using weak cushion armor instead of setting an objective line.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="defect-card">
          <h3><span>🏗️ 3</span> Operational Disconnect Distortion</h3>
          <p>Hiding behind a "Jargon Wall" of domain-specific terminology instead of defining the raw functional process.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="defect-card">
          <h3><span>📉 4</span> Asymmetrical Resolution Distortion</h3>
          <p>Pairing a massive macro problem statement with an inadequate, localized patch.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="defect-card">
          <h3><span>☁️ 5</span> Textual Contamination Distortion ('Word Fluff')</h3>
          <p>System-wide injection of emotional adjectives, recursive adverbs, or passive filler that buries the logic line under an amorphous cloud of vapor.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
